&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE OpenQueryFaixaChave DBOProgram 
PROCEDURE OpenQueryFaixaChave :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:     
  Parameters:  <none>
  Notes:       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

    OPEN QUERY {&QueryName} 
        FOR EACH {&TableName} NO-LOCK 
            WHERE {&TableName}.cod-estabel  >= c-cod-estabel-ini
            AND   {&TableName}.cod-estabel  <= c-cod-estabel-fim
            AND   {&TableName}.data         >= dt-data-ini
            AND   {&TableName}.data         <= dt-data-fim
            AND   {&TableName}.cod-prod     >= i-cod-prod-ini
            AND   {&TableName}.cod-prod     <= i-cod-prod-fim
            INDEXED-REPOSITION.

    RETURN "OK":U.

END PROCEDURE.

/* _UIB-CODE-BLOCK-END */
&ANALYZE-RESUME

